    the order for the capecitabine includes description of the item.
    the order for the capecitabine includes quantity to be dispensed.
    the order for the capecitabine includes treating practitioner name.
    the order for the capecitabine was communicated to the supplier on 2026-02-22.
    the capecitabine was delivered on 2026-03-01.
    the supplier holds proof of delivery for the capecitabine.
